{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日から、\n〇〇のフレンズだね!\nと言うのが、メンバーで流行っています。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3TTTV2B0P3E7F2YKTRG7K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺーちゃんは、ねこのフレンズ 、\nあかねんは、ホワイトタイガーの赤ちゃんのフレンズです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"、織田奈那がメンバーの中で一番可愛い声で〇〇のフレンズだね!と言うことが出来ます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は何の動物のフレンズかなあ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN3TWBQPS599RADZ0XBPK0C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}